Cell["\<\
We are going to build code and explore the behavior of the system on the \
standard section. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9724685303738265`*^9, 3.9724685603107805`*^9}, {
  3.9724756282093115`*^9, 
  3.9724756446927023`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f7146b95-3b7f-4e3d-8ccd-\
